 ("/**\n * @author Eric Zhao\n * @since 1.7.0\n */", "/**\n * 支持按资源类型分类的 Sph 扩展接口。\n *\n * @author Eric Zhao\n * @since 1.7.0\n */"),
 ("    /**\n     * Record statistics and perform rule checking for the given resource with provided classification.\n     *", "    /**\n     * 对给定分类的资源记录统计并执行规则检查。\n     *"),
